{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-categorical-lagrangian-exists","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:categorical-lagrangian-exists","kind":"proposition","title":"Existence of the categorical Lagrangian","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-categorical-lagrangian","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-categorical-dirac-operator-exists"],"proofs":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prf-categorical-lagrangian-exists"],"tags":["existence","lagrangian"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.CategoricalLagrangian.exists","text":"categorical-lagrangian-exists.md","leanSource":"categorical-lagrangian-exists.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:categorical-lagrangian-exists\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(\\mathbf{C}, A, \\tau)</code> be a quantum observable universe with categorical Dirac operator <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{D}_\\nabla</code> and state <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\psi \\colon \\mathbf{1} \\to A</code>. The categorical Lagrangian <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{L}_q(\\nabla, \\psi) = \\mathcal{D}_\\nabla^2 + \\psi^* \\otimes \\mathcal{D}_\\nabla \\psi \\in \\mathrm{End}_{\\mathbf{C}}(A)</code> exists as an endomorphism of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A</code>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-lagrangian-exists.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"4.13.2","page":"b/prop-categorical-lagrangian-exists","qa":{"counts":{"pass":90,"fail":0,"warn":1,"na":13,"unknown":0,"stale":70},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":1}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.CategoricalLagrangian.exists","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-obs